    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your\u00a0 wildest character ideas in Creator<strong>RPG</strong>! Choose from 15 different archetypes to build any character you might imagine, and team them up with up to two other creations to battle any challenge that might await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Experience colorful stories in Venture Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the game through Venture Mode, tactical dungeon crawler, that uses Rogue-lite elements to make each individual dungeon you explore its own replayable story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share and Battle in Clash Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against your friends custom teams in Clash Mode! Hone your tactics, and take on CPU challenges to steel yourself against all sorts of tactics.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your\u00a0 wildest character ideas in Creator<strong>RPG</strong>! Choose from 15 different archetypes to build any character you might imagine, and team them up with up to two other creations to battle any challenge that might await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Experience colorful stories in Venture Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the game through Venture Mode, tactical dungeon crawler, that uses Rogue-lite elements to make each individual dungeon you explore its own replayable story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share and Battle in Clash Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against your friends custom teams in Clash Mode! Hone your tactics, and take on CPU challenges to steel yourself against all sorts of tactics.</p>",
    "short_description": "Creation and combat go hand in hand in CreatorRPG. Choose from 15 different Archetypes to build, edit, and perfect your own characters to battle against fellow builders and monsters alike. No idea is too creative.",
